      "content": "i dont know... it just feels like a coping mechanism. pretending the small stuff matters just feels like a distraction from the fact that we're just cosmic accidents. if nothing matters, then the effort to \"stay positive\" or \"keep going\" feels like running in place. it's exhausting.",
